\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Conditional attention and historical-feedback gated fusion. (a) The conditional attention block consists of control point self-attention, global-map cross-attention and a feed-forward network, and extracts control features through time-condition modulation and residual connections. (b) Historical safety correction features are fused into the current control features through a feedback validity flag and channel-wise gating.}}{4}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fusion}{{2}{4}{Conditional attention and historical-feedback gated fusion. (a) The conditional attention block consists of control point self-attention, global-map cross-attention and a feed-forward network, and extracts control features through time-condition modulation and residual connections. (b) Historical safety correction features are fused into the current control features through a feedback validity flag and channel-wise gating}{figure.2}{}}
