\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Local safety feature and ellipse geometry prediction. Safety centers are sampled at fixed positions along the selected route, and a spatial distance bias between the centers and the map positions is added to the cross-attention; the resulting safety latent features are passed through an ellipse shape head that outputs the local semi-axes and orientation, which are used for the subsequent convex safe region construction.}}{5}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:geom}{{3}{5}{Local safety feature and ellipse geometry prediction. Safety centers are sampled at fixed positions along the selected route, and a spatial distance bias between the centers and the map positions is added to the cross-attention; the resulting safety latent features are passed through an ellipse shape head that outputs the local semi-axes and orientation, which are used for the subsequent convex safe region construction}{figure.3}{}}
